# W1, guest b (k2): at its lobby gate while a's instance runs in stag0101: I1a joins it automatically (the first
# row, DW4_ONLINE_AUTOCHOICE first); in stag0101 its engine has a's story (key item 4, which b's own story lacks); its
# gate disc takes it home onto its own story again (19.30.4, 19.8.3).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until frames>=120 fail key:4=1
log own story at home
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log b in stag0101
idle until frames>=120 fail key:4=0
log b plays a's story
follow 40 until sealed>=6000
log together
disk 8 until stage=stagml11,control
log b home by the gate disc
idle until frames>=120 fail key:4=1
log own story again at home
